== Trivia ==
* In Edmund McMillen's [https://youtu.be/kby0rXT7qYQ first post-Repentance Lore Stream], he revealed that Rotten Meat was intended to be a reference to the [[zelda:Food#The Legend of Zelda|meat]] which must be fed to the Hungry [[zelda:Goriya|Goriya]] which blocks the path in the original [[wikipedia:The Legend of Zelda (video game)|Legend of Zelda]].
** However, the food from the Legend of Zelda is not ''necessarily'' rotten.
* Rotten Meat’s sprites can be seen as part of {{I|Binge Eater}}.
* Rotten Meat is the only item affected by Binge Eater that does not have the name of a type of meal.

